    "stem": "Education, a marker of socioeconomic status, was one of the potential confounders considered in the study of pesticide use (exposure) and breast cancer (outcome) in a published paper by Teitelbaum et al. (2007).\nWhich one of the options can explain why education was considered to be a potential\nconfounder?",
