    "stem": "A randomized, placebo-controlled trial was conducted In Indonesia to study the effects of Vitamin A in preventing deaths among children with measles. The investigator reported a Relative risk (RR) of 0.60 for the intervention versus the control group. What does the RR of 0.60 of the previous study means?",
